# Throwaway harness entry points. Bundling a component in isolation (esbuild +
# Playwright, to look at a portrait at four sizes or a map at three development
# levels) needs its entry file to sit where `react` resolves from, which means
# the project root. These are scratch and must never be committed.
__*_harness_entry.tsx
.*-harness.tsx
